---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="坐标与姿态换算"
  description="在浏览器里把经纬高、ECEF、NED/ENU 互转，并把四元数、ZYX 欧拉角和旋转矩阵互转。计算都在本地完成。"
>
  <div class="container page gif-tool">
    <a class="text-link" href="/tools/">
      ← 所有小工具
    </a>
    <div class="eyebrow">TOOLS / 坐标与姿态</div>
    <h1>坐标与姿态换算</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      改完一组数，按对应的按钮换算。经纬度用
      WGS84，单位是度；高度和地心坐标是米。姿态默认用度，四元数标量在前。
    </p>

    <div class="gif-card">
      <h2>位置</h2>
      <p class="tool-note">
        ECEF 原点在地心，X 指向经度 0°、纬度 0°，Z 指向北极。NED
        是北、东、地，ENU 是东、北、天，都相对下面的参考点。经纬高和 ECEF
        互转不用参考点。
      </p>
      <div class="gif-grid">
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="lat">纬度（度）</label>
          <input
            id="lat"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.000001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="lon">经度（度）</label>
          <input
            id="lon"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.000001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="alt">椭球高（米）</label>
          <input
            id="alt"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.01"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="ecef-x">ECEF X（米）</label>
          <input
            id="ecef-x"
            type="number"
            value="6378137"
            step="0.001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="ecef-y">ECEF Y（米）</label>
          <input
            id="ecef-y"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="ecef-z">ECEF Z（米）</label>
          <input
            id="ecef-z"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="ned-n">NED 北（米）</label>
          <input
            id="ned-n"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="ned-e">NED 东（米）</label>
          <input
            id="ned-e"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="ned-d">NED 地（米）</label>
          <input
            id="ned-d"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="enu-e">ENU 东（米）</label>
          <input
            id="enu-e"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="enu-n">ENU 北（米）</label>
          <input
            id="enu-n"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="enu-u">ENU 天（米）</label>
          <input
            id="enu-u"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="ref-lat">参考纬度（度）</label>
          <input
            id="ref-lat"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.000001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="ref-lon">参考经度（度）</label>
          <input
            id="ref-lon"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.000001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="ref-alt">参考高度（米）</label>
          <input
            id="ref-alt"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.01"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="gif-actions">
        <button type="button" id="from-lla" class="gif-primary">
          从经纬高换算
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="from-ecef" class="gif-secondary">
          从 ECEF 换算
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="from-ned" class="gif-secondary">
          从 NED 换算
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="from-enu" class="gif-secondary">
          从 ENU 换算
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gif-card">
      <h2>姿态</h2>
      <p class="tool-note">
        四元数是标量在前的 Hamilton 约定 (w, x, y,
        z)，也可以改成标量在后，只改变四个输入的排列。欧拉角是内旋 ZYX：先绕 Z
        偏航，再绕 Y 俯仰，再绕 X 滚转。旋转矩阵把载体系向量变到导航系，v_nav =
        R v_body，按行填写。俯仰接近 ±90° 时，偏航和滚转不能唯一分开。
      </p>
      <div class="gif-grid">
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="unit">欧拉角单位</label>
          <select id="unit">
            <option value="deg" selected>
              度
            </option>
            <option value="rad">弧度</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="order">四元数顺序</label>
          <select id="order">
            <option value="wxyz" selected>
              标量在前 w x y z
            </option>
            <option value="xyzw">标量在后 x y z w</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="roll">滚转 roll</label>
          <input
            id="roll"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="pitch">俯仰 pitch</label>
          <input
            id="pitch"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="yaw">偏航 yaw</label>
          <input
            id="yaw"
            type="number"
            value="90"
            step="0.001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="q0">
            <span id="qlabel-0">w</span>
          </label>
          <input
            id="q0"
            type="number"
            value="0.707107"
            step="0.000001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="q1">
            <span id="qlabel-1">x</span>
          </label>
          <input
            id="q1"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.000001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="q2">
            <span id="qlabel-2">y</span>
          </label>
          <input
            id="q2"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.000001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="gif-field">
          <label for="q3">
            <span id="qlabel-3">z</span>
          </label>
          <input
            id="q3"
            type="number"
            value="0.707107"
            step="0.000001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="gif-field">
        <label>旋转矩阵（行优先）</label>
        <div class="matrix">
          <input
            id="m00"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.000001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
          <input
            id="m01"
            type="number"
            value="-1"
            step="0.000001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
          <input
            id="m02"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.000001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
          <input
            id="m10"
            type="number"
            value="1"
            step="0.000001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
          <input
            id="m11"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.000001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
          <input
            id="m12"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.000001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
          <input
            id="m20"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.000001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
          <input
            id="m21"
            type="number"
            value="0"
            step="0.000001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
          <input
            id="m22"
            type="number"
            value="1"
            step="0.000001"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="gif-actions">
        <button type="button" id="from-euler" class="gif-primary">
          从欧拉角换算
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="from-quat" class="gif-secondary">
          从四元数换算
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="from-matrix" class="gif-secondary">
          从旋转矩阵换算
        </button>
      </div>
      <p id="status" class="gif-status" role="status"></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>

<script>
  import '../../scripts/coord-convert';
</script>
